cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Structural analysis solvers tailored for semi-analytical models
type: software
abstract: >-
  The `structsolve` module provides structural analysis solvers based on
  SciPy sparse matrices, tailored for semi-analytical models, such as the
  Ritz models of plates and shells. Usually, this module is used for:

  * Linear static analyses

  * Linear buckling analyses

  * Frequency analyses

  * Non-linear static analyses, using the Newton-Raphson method or the
    arc-length methods of Riks and Crisfield
message: >-
